- training/defect_train/architecture.py: get_pdn_small and get_autoencoder are
  copied from common.py without changes.
- training/defect_train/architecture.py: AnomalyNet.forward is adapted from predict
  in efficientad.py. It returns only the combined map, and it can run without the
  autoencoder.
- training/defect_train/train_loop.py: the training loop and the normalization are
  adapted from efficientad.py. Saving and resuming are new.
- training/defect_train/data.py: the image transforms follow efficientad.py, on
  OpenCV images instead of PIL images.

Not included in this repository, and downloaded when training:

- The pretrained teacher, models/teacher_small.pth, from the project above.
- MVTec AD, under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0: https://www.mvtec.com/company/research/datasets/mvtec-ad
- Imagenette: https://github.com/fastai/imagenette
